      "writtenOn": "2026-02-25T22:31:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the problem is you are adding this functionality to all architectures and now x86 doesn\u0027t know how to handle this extra padding versus its fpu area. Have you thought about doing this extra padding only from the architectures that you need? Similar to how x86 does it here? This approach seems more reasonable to me.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "8c75bd2379a0794c76db15f50e2706a8c041ca7a",
